# ── Secrets. Nothing in this group may ever be committed. ──────────────────────
# A commit does not remove a secret — it only stops it being in the WORKING TREE.
# Once pushed, it is in the history for ever, and the only real remedy is to
# rotate the credential. Treat an accidental commit as a disclosure, not a typo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
certs/
secrets/

# ── Local state that is not source ─────────────────────────────────────────────
backups/
server/data/
data/uploads/
*.sqlite
*.db

# ── Build / tooling noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
node_modules/
.dart_tool/
build/
*.bak
*.bak.*
.DS_Store
